    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Detroit Metropolitan Airport\nPhoto by Larry Wint",
      "dp\nMADE BY\nDEXTER PRESS\nWEST NYACK, NEW YORK\nDester\nSUPREME\nPENROD/HIAWATHA Co.,\nBerrien Center, Mich\nAll rights\nreserved.\nigan\n49102\nPost Card\n9101\nDETROIT METROPOLITAN AIRPORT - \"Metropolitan,\"\none of the country's foremost international\njetports\nis operated by the Wayne County Road Commission.\nDaily departures and arrivals,\nto and from\npoints\nthroughout\nthe world,\naccommodate the\nflow\npassengers and cargo\nso vital\nto\nDetroit\nand its\nsurrounding area of\ncommerce, industry, finance and\nrecreation.\nDT-36747-D\n015.166\n1922"
    ],
